### Tao san pham
POST http://localhost:8080/inventories
Content-Type: application/json

{"productId": 2, "productName": "iPhone 15", "quantity": 20}

### Xem thong tin (lay version)
GET http://localhost:8080/inventories/1

### Nhap hang (Pessimistic Lock)
POST http://localhost:8080/inventories/1/stock-in
Content-Type: application/json

{"quantity": 5}

### Sua thong tin (Optimistic Lock) - gui lai lan 2 voi version cu => 409
PUT http://localhost:8080/inventories/1
Content-Type: application/json

{"productName": "Laptop Dell XPS 15", "version": 0}

### Lich su thay doi (Envers)
GET http://localhost:8080/inventories/1/history
